WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.900
Differential stress can rotate minerals and favor growth in

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.980
preferred orientations. Fine cleavage in slate differs from larger

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:10.540
aligned mica in schist. Foliation is a planar fabric,

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.180
not one rock name. Changing conditions drive mineral reactions

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:18.060
and grain growth. Coarse light and dark bands characterize

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:22.900
gneiss. Parent composition matters; every rock does not automatically

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:27.780
follow this sequence. Quartz-rich sandstone can recrystallize into quartzite.

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:31.340
Carbonate rock can become marble. Both can have interlocking

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.880
crystals without foliation. Use composition as well as texture.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:38.180
Lack of foliation does not exclude metamorphism.
